{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/alta-meteora-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":569,"crm_id":"1002","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Alta","slug":"alta-meteora-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Meteora","price":1612000,"display_price":"1.612M","lattitude":25.0599779,"longitude":55.2065352,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Alta - an exciting project by developer Meteora, located in the JVC neighbourhood. The building consists of 24 floors and offers elegant <strong>studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms.</strong> The interiors of each residence combine luxury, functionality and comfort, making each room an unforgettable cosy atmosphere.</p><p>The complex offers its residents many amenities for recreation and leisure. On the territory there are adult and children's swimming pools, playgrounds for various sports, green garden with recreation areas, children's playground, as well as an open-air cinema. There are many picturesque parks and the Circle Mall, as well as cafes, restaurants. kindergartens, schools and medical facilities in the immediate vicinity.</p><p>JVC is uniquely located near Dubai's main motorways - Al Khail Road and Hessa Street, so residents can quickly reach the main attractions of the city. The Circle Mall and the famous Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden are approximately 10 minutes away, while the Mall of Emirates, Dubai Marina, Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa are all within 15-20 minutes.</p><p>Alta is the ideal destination for those looking for contemporary accommodation that combines style, quality and convenience. A high degree of attention to detail, sensitivity to residents' nee